## Implementation Details

The implementation follows the exact pattern from the official Vercel documentation:

### For Next.js App Router (Current Setup):
- Analytics component imported from `@vercel/analytics/next`
- Placed in the root layout (`app/layout.js`)
- Rendered just before closing `</body>` tag for optimal performance
- No additional configuration needed

### What This Provides:
- Automatic page view tracking
- Client-side navigation tracking for Next.js routes
- Performance monitoring
- Real-time analytics in Vercel dashboard (when deployed)
- Zero configuration required beyond component placement

