## Recommendation

The Vercel Web Analytics integration is complete and follows best practices. To start seeing data:
1. Ensure the project is deployed to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard under your project's Analytics tab
3. Analytics will automatically begin tracking once users visit the deployed site

No further action is required for the Analytics integration itself.
